It merged through the queue at 2026-11-04T04:51Z. `@objectstack/spec/system` now exports:
- `PLATFORM_LOCALES`: 11 rows in menu order, deep-frozen, with `rtl` only on `ar`;
- `PLATFORM_LOCALE_TAGS`;
- `PLATFORM_LOCALE_READ_ALIASES`, typed on its ten keys;
